+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project's recorded decision for cache eviction is LRU (Least Recently Used) combined with a 300-second TTL: entries are evicted based on recency of access, and any entry is automatically expired after 300 seconds regardless of access pattern, giving more predictable cache behavior.
